      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为米浴的一个小小举动，\n引发了和＜First＞队进行一场\n以操场为赌注的非正规赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48dd51719069900cf38d303990e2388ef25b8bf6626ae22c54064b18c5e877f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
