      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使得到只要赢一场就算胜利的让步，\n队伍成员依然全数败北。\n背负大家最后希望的米浴也惨败……",
      "source_fingerprint": "53566b3fbb74dc2c34b16ce26c6faa0b8f013284fa575955125e0ff4a67b80ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
