      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然最后这场赌注无效，\n但只有米浴一人依然表情阴郁，\n精神也没有恢复。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43076c3ff466b95811c2d94ab2bb4381be54013060fa739208b47f74a0ed9fe2",
